1
00:04:31,578 --> 00:04:37,578
Delivering justice, one shell at a time...

2
00:09:03,157 --> 00:09:09,157
Hobo with a Shotgun is a crime, action, thriller film directed by Jason Eisener.

3
00:13:34,736 --> 00:13:40,736
A vigilante homeless man pulls into a new city and finds himself trapped in urban
chaos, a city where crime rules and where the city's crime boss reigns.

4
00:18:06,315 --> 00:18:12,315
Seeing an urban landscape filled with armed robbers, corrupt cops, abused prostitutes and even a pedophile Santa,
the Hobo goes about bringing justice to the city the best way he knows how - with a 20-gauge shotgun.

5
00:22:37,894 --> 00:22:43,894
Mayhem ensues when he tries to make things better for the future generation.

6
00:27:09,473 --> 00:27:15,473
Street justice will indeed prevail.

7
00:31:41,052 --> 00:31:47,052
Hobo, played by Rutger Hauer.

8
