12
00:54:18,947 --> 00:54:24,947
Ivan / Rip, played by Nick Bateman.

13
00:58:50,526 --> 00:58:56,526
Hobo with a Shotgun is a 2011 exploitation black comedy action film
directed by Jason Eisener and written by John Davies.

14
01:03:22,105 --> 01:03:28,105
Based on Eisener's fictitious trailer of the same name from Grindhouse (2007), it is the second feature-length
adaptation of a fictitious Grindhouse trailer, following Robert Rodriguez's Machete (2010).

15
01:07:53,684 --> 01:07:59,684
Hobo with a Shotgun premiered at the Sundance Film Festival on January 21,
2011, on March 25 in Canada, and on May 6 in the United States.

16
01:12:25,263 --> 01:12:31,263
The film received mixed reviews from critics and has become a cult film.

17
01:16:56,842 --> 01:17:02,842
The film explores themes of prostitute, shotgun, dystopia, pimp, vigilante.

18
01:21:28,421 --> 01:21:34,421
The tone is dark and intense.
